#: src/Link.php:57
msgid "One-Time Secret"
msgstr "一次性嘅秘密"

#: src/Secret.php:182
msgid "Hi,"
msgstr "嗨，"

#: src/Secret.php:183
msgid ""
"As mentioned in our previous conversation, this message is meant to share "
"sensitive information with you."
msgstr "正如我們之前的對話中提到的，此敏感信息只與您共享。"

#: src/Secret.php:184
msgid ""
"A secret link <b>only works once</b> and <b>then disappears forever</b>. Do "
"not open it if you are not the intended recipient."
msgstr ""
"秘密鏈接<b>只工作一次</b>，<b>然後永遠消失</b>。如果您不是預定的收件人，請不"
"要打開它。"

#: src/Secret.php:185
msgid "Here you have"
msgstr "你原有嘅喺哩到"

#: src/Secret.php:186
msgid "your secret link"
msgstr "你的秘密鏈結"

#: src/Secret.php:189
msgid ""
"I will send you the required passphrase to open it using an alternative "
"method for security reasons."
msgstr "基於安全理由，我將會給您發出替代性的密碼用作打開它。"

#: src/Secret.php:191
msgid "Bear in mind:"
msgstr "記得："

#: src/Secret.php:191
msgid "A secret link can only be opened once and will expire afterwards."
msgstr "哩個秘密鏈結只可以打開一次，開過一次之後就會過期用唔到。"

#: src/Secret.php:192
#, php-format
msgid "This secret link will expire %1$s after its generation."
msgstr "這個密碼連結會在 %1$s 產生後到期。"

#: src/Secret.php:193
msgid "Regards,"
msgstr "問候，"

#: src/Config.php:189
